The '''City Bigspace''' was a large hydrostatic [[force field]] bubble located in the [[Gungan]] [[city]] of [[Otoh Gunga]]. It was one of many bubbles added to the city by [[Rugor Nass]] during his rule, and was visited by Gungans from around [[Naboo]].<ref name="SWCL" />

